{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36168","headline":"寄杭州于郎中 · 方干","name":"寄杭州于郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽云圣代识贤明，自是山河应数生。\n大雅篇章无弟子，高门世业有公卿。\n入楼早月中秋色，遶郭寒潮半夜声。\n白屋青云至悬阔，愚儒肝胆若爲倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}